<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Resources yr net down 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Resources yr net down 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		55.60	  vs	  65.38</p>
<p>    Shr	  (cents)    11.00	  vs	  13.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		 897.92	  vs	 460.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 185.45	  vs	 122.86</p>
<p>    Minorities    less    46.70	  vs  less   8.27</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	467.21	  vs	   3.06</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Malaysian Resources Corporation Bhd. It is involved in power generation, media, property development and financial services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
